    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA beautifully presented three-bedroom home offering a perfect blend of modern comfort and functional living. The property features a bright and spacious living room, ideal for both relaxing and entertaining, complemented by a contemporary kitchen finished to a high standard with ample storage and workspace. The property additionally benefits with on street parking. \n\nThe accommodation includes three well-proportioned bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from a stylish en suite. A sleek and modern family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms. An added highlight of the home is the attic conversion, providing a versatile space suitable for a home office, guest room, or additional living area. To the rear, the property has a private patio area, perfect for outdoor dining and enjoying sunny days.\n\nEast Wall is a mature and well-established area enjoying café's, bars, pharmacies, supermarkets Aldi & Lidl, Dublin Port Tunnel and Fairview Park very nearby and is also within walking distance of the City Centre & IFSC. The 3 Arena, Docklands Dart Station and Luas Red Line are all within walking distance away also. This attractive home is sure to be of immense interest to both first time buyers and investors alike due to its superbly convenient location and its excellent potential to create a wonderful family home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 0.904m x 0.937m\nWelcoming entrance giving access to the living & dining room.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 4.996m x 4.150m\nSpacious reception room with a bright aspect taking in natural light throughout the day. A generous dining area is located off the kitchen to the rear.\n\nKitchen - 3.215m x 1.324m\nWell-appointed modern kitchen with a tiled floor, ample storage in the floor and wall-mounted cupboards, integrated appliances including a fridge/freezer and dishwasher, oven and hob and built in breakfast bar.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.869m x 3.746m\nMain double bedroom with laminate wooden flooring, access to the patio and en-suite.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.400m x 2.021m\nSecond spacious double bedroom with laminate flooring & access to the patio.\n\nStudy - 3.229m x 1.907m\nStudy located off the hall with laminate wooden flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.079m x 1.102m\nFully tiled shower room with a wc, whb, located in the hall.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.705m x 0.962m\nFully tiled en-suite with wc and shower.\n\nAttic Conversion - 4.502m x 2.896m\nGenerous attic conversion with a and large sky light flooding the room with light.\n\nPatio - 1.551m x 1.750m\nA peaceful patio space located off bedroom one and two to the rear of the property.\n\n"
      },
      {
